{"version":1,"key":"card:317","content":{"id":317,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"可以针对不同的媒体类型应用不同的样式，由四种方法可以进行媒体查询："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"link","code":true}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"style","code":true}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"@import","code":true}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"@media","code":true}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"下面是一些示例"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"<link type=\"text/css\" href=\"screen.css\" media=\"screen\" />\n<style media=\"print\">\n\t/*  */\n</style>","language":"html","uuid":"a8f10c9e-5f9e-46ff-9820-bfc36f2bef83","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"@import(base.css) screen;\n\n@media print and (color) {\n  \n}","language":"CSS","uuid":"b93a5ee1-f45a-4c3b-95b7-3e35f94f7ed7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"存在如下列出的基本媒体类型："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"all","code":true},{"text":"：所有的媒体","type":"formatted"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"print","code":true},{"text":"：打印文档时使用，或者预览打印效果时","type":"formatted"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"screen","code":true},{"text":"：屏幕显示器","type":"formatted"}]}]}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"info","title":"","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"某些浏览器支持 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"projection","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 类型；某些移动设备支持 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"handheld","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 类型。"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"可以通过媒体描述符更进一步的描述媒体"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"print and (color) /* 彩色打印 */\nscreen and (min-width: 600px) /* 屏幕最小宽度为 600px */","language":"css","uuid":"c232f1e6-1080-47a6-832d-ecfef1e52173","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"(color)","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","text":"(min-width: 600px)","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 就是媒体描述符，描述符需要放在圆括号中，如果使用媒体描述符时没有指定媒体类型，那就相当于默认使用了 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"all","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 这种媒体类型。"}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"info","title":"","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"媒体描述符一般同 CSS 声明一般，一般都为键值对的形式，但是媒体描述符有点不同的是，它可以不指定值，比如 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"(color)","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 表示彩色，没有指定值。"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"多个媒体描述符之间可以通过逻辑词进行连接，由两种关键词："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"and","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"：表示必须同时满足"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"print and (color) and (min-device-width: 800px)","language":"css","uuid":"784f17ed-bbad-441f-bfbf-fb30c9f7ca3a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"not","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"：对整个查询取反，必须放在媒体查询的开头，否则无效"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"not (color) and (oritentation: landscape)","language":"css","uuid":"db34fd4d-130f-4eb8-9db5-e138b67d59ad","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"note","title":"","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"媒体查询不支持 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"or","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 关键字，但是多个逗号分隔的媒体查询相当于 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"or","code":true}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"screen, print /* 在屏幕或打印时生效 */","language":"css","uuid":"3ea7984a-756c-4a16-8c6e-40236f1be656","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参考："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"《CSS 权威指南》：1.5媒体查询"}]}]}]}],"tags":["CSS/媒体查询"],"createTime":1695001529136,"updateTime":1743303640425,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743303640425}}